t whispers to you at night from the darkness. It entices all who come into contact. And it has seemingly passed through many hands throughout history, leaving it's own undeniable mark on the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506900/extras/53aca3f4a15c40b5fc3690095b6d14a6.webp?t=1742083886\" width=508 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506900/extras/3e6ab5fe88cd64f3d40cb560eb67571c.poster.avif?t=1742083886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506900/extras/3e6ab5fe88cd64f3d40cb560eb67571c.webm?t=1742083886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506900/extras/3e6ab5fe88cd64f3d40cb560eb67571c.mp4?t=1742083886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eerie loneliness and dark rooms of the empty ship play tricks on the eyes, creating fears which erode at the edges of the mind. Seek out solitude in the light, and find comfort in mementos of your life and loved ones... or else let your mind unravel, to be lost to the tides of madness</p>",
